- CONTENT INVENTORY AND PRIORITIES
=====================================

https://fcr-ccc.nrcan-rncan.gc.ca/en/Search 

1. CONTENT AREAS
----------------
Existing (NRCan Fuel Consumption Ratings Search Tool):
- Search tips
- Vehicle filters (type, model year, class, make, model)
- Units selector (L/100 km, mpg imperial, mpg US)
- Advanced search (transmission, fuel, cylinders)
- Personalize (km per year, % city driving, fuel prices)
- Results tables (conventional/hybrid, plug-in hybrid, electric)
- Compare and saved vehicles
- Understanding the tables / Fuel Consumption Guide links

Proposed (FuelFare):
- Home, Calculate Trip, Trip Results, My Garage, Add Vehicle,
  Saved Trips, Gas Prices, Help & Contact


