4. GAPS, DUPLICATES AND CONFUSING TERMS
---------------------------------------
Gaps:        No way to calculate a single trip's cost or save a trip.
Duplicates:  Three separate results tables repeat the same columns.
Confusing:   "Le/100 km" next to "L/100 km", mpg where higher is better
             vs L/100 km where lower is better, and "Personalize" does not
             say it is for cost estimates.